{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0252_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1b5a1bec2546d98e19a9e10da45e91bd35fa1277cad237d8f8be09479408a0cf", "ja": "（ファミレスのブラジルフェアで、\nエレナが店員を務めた。大好評だったな！）", "zh": "（在家庭餐厅举办的巴西美食活动上，艾蕾娜担任了店员。大受好评啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0252_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "c743f316ebf3e11e9ac6f36c4881020a8811c216be93357ce02894d104e11c0a", "ja": "{$P$}、シュラスコのお肉\nどうだった？　お腹いっぱいになったカナー？", "zh": "{$P$}，巴西烤肉的肉怎么样？吃得饱饱的了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0252_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6553ad53c31ad131276d92260d6b201dcfe5ec130a94442902bf0bcd12c78561", "ja": "うっぷ……ああ、おいしかったよ！\nちょっと盛りすぎだった気はするけど……。", "zh": "嗝……啊，很好吃哦！\n不过感觉好像盛得有点太多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0252_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "48fec664d86fdc03bc8ad285822556a2119ad40b166d69ee5d8841540e9a4d69", "ja": "そう？　モリモリにしてたら、お客さんも、\n取材に来た記者さんも、大喜びだったヨ～？", "zh": "是吗？我把分量加得满满的，客人和来采访的记者也都特别开心哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0252_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "7b41e897e52646a09422cb9ad0c9218ea6cfb3c4415ee339242aa466e1d42ee5", "ja": "店長さんも、今日はドンドンやって\nイイヨ～って。これでお店の宣伝もバッチリだよネ！", "zh": "店长也说了，今天尽管放开做\n没关系哦～。这样一来宣传效果绝对很棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0252_1005_p", "source_sha256": "caca036e8fbbb3da390c93a12303d5c1fdbc1e545c17609d5d852d2d2dd3d62c", "ja": "そうだな、お疲れ様。エレナこそ、\n動きっぱなしでお腹空いたんじゃないか？", "zh": "是啊，辛苦了。倒是艾蕾娜，你一直忙个不停，肚子饿了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0252_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "446d6ab4b57f9defff9b5b44d6a85cb60ee401b3f1f0a148d051138f3ae308a7", "ja": "そうなんだヨ～、お腹ペコペコ！\nワタシもシュラスコ、食べたかったナ～……。", "zh": "就是这样呀～，肚子都饿扁了！\n我也好想吃烤肉啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0252_1007_p", "source_sha256": "94dacc2da61b5aca51655c46b85995a427795bd43744380a8ea5f3a195f0c9fa", "ja": "よし、ならエレナの分はご馳走するよ。\n頑張ってくれたからな。", "zh": "好，那我请艾莲娜吃吧。\n毕竟你那么努力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0252_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0252_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "bff25574726cc15ee72fb2cecdfd3c10b9221b0752554c634c4e876c559b90f6", "ja": "ヤッター！　それなら、{$P$}に\n切り分けて欲しいナ。モリモリで……エヘヘっ♪", "zh": "太好了！那就请{$P$}帮我切一下吧。要满满一大份……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
